{"$schema":"folio-archimate-normalised/v1","id":"id-dthhrh-overlay-0-1-0-draft-1","name":"DTH-HRH overlay on the DPI-H reference architecture","file":"0.1.0-draft.1/dth-hrh-overlay.archimate","documentation":"Overlay of dth-hrh on smart-ra ArchiMate 0.2.0. Elements tagged overlay:base are reference copies of smart-ra elements (the IRI names the original); elements tagged overlay:owner=dth-hrh are added by this DTH (the NHWA work) and are not part of smart-ra. Built by scripts/archimate/extract_overlay.py.","properties":[],"elements":[{"id":"id-3d0c2c2525ed4131ae533eed8893d4d0","type":"Capability","name":"Analytics & Business Intelligence","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-3d0c2c2525ed4131ae533eed8893d4d0.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-788f660553e14f0283b93c2dda3ae441","type":"Capability","name":"Client Identity Management","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-788f660553e14f0283b93c2dda3ae441.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-88a90dfa38904fba930a49add401e660","type":"Capability","name":"Governance, Policy, and Legislation","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-88a90dfa38904fba930a49add401e660.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-34c4ebbdf32b4062b7fe81718c599d83","type":"Capability","name":"Health Financing Management","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-34c4ebbdf32b4062b7fe81718c599d83.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-4d0a6161789f4a4ca8b13c7b2d542544","type":"Capability","name":"Health Workforce Management","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-4d0a6161789f4a4ca8b13c7b2d542544.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-02200ff02be649ada1bf34a0a4d8e594","type":"Capability","name":"Interoperability Management","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-02200ff02be649ada1bf34a0a4d8e594.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-d4539867eb074f9383ede25c9318a5eb","type":"Capability","name":"Privacy / Concent/ Trust","layer":"Strategy","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-d4539867eb074f9383ede25c9318a5eb.jsonld"}],"folder":["Strategy","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-e162b2223da4440983514be5854b654d","type":"DataObject","name":"CDE-HWR: Core Data Elements for the Health Workforce Registry","layer":"Application","documentation":"CDE-HWR: the Core Data Elements of the Health Workforce Registry. The deliberately minimal record the HWR holds as the system of record for each health worker:\n1. Named demographics (name, sex, date of birth).\n2. Identifier and index: the national unique health worker identifier, with cross-references to foundational ID where the law allows.\n3. Licensure: licence number, issuing body, status, validity dates.\n4. Registration: professional registration and cadre (ISCO-08 based health worker classification).\n5. Educational credential: qualification, awarding institution, year.\n6. Organizational affiliation: employer or other affiliating organization.\n7. Facility association: the facility or facilities where the worker practises, by Facility Registry identifier.\nAnything else (employment transactions, payroll, training history, etc.) stays in the operational system that owns it.","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Application"]},{"id":"id-145e885489634e469e8a6734f56b7df5","type":"DataObject","name":"NHWA Dataset (linking and indexing, built on CDE-HWR)","layer":"Application","documentation":"National Health Workforce Accounts (NHWA) dataset. Not a second registry: an analytical linking and indexing dataset that builds on CDE-HWR. The HWR identifier is the key that links records about the same worker held in other data systems, which the NHWA handbook lists as potential data sources: the health workforce registry or database, facility administrative records and HMIS, professional council registers, labour force surveys and population census. From these, the 29 NHWA indicators in 4 modules are computed (1 stock and flow; 2 education; 3 finance and expenditures; 4 working conditions, governance and leadership) and reported nationally and to the WHO NHWA platform. Source: WHO, National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed., 2023 (ISBN 9789240081291): the NHWA is \"a system by which countries progressively improve the availability, quality, and use of data on health workforce through monitoring of a set of indicators\", using diverse existing data sources (core principles: multi-sectoral governance, progressive implementation, no primary data collection).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Application"]},{"id":"id-3c5d846710034c4595e206e748d65e36","type":"ApplicationComponent","name":"DPI-F Information Mediator","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-3c5d846710034c4595e206e748d65e36.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-d79aa0eec0584b0792b44bca408afeb6","type":"ApplicationComponent","name":"DPI-F Security & Consent Module","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-d79aa0eec0584b0792b44bca408afeb6.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-350840520ae44f658b6ad3b3762e382e","type":"ApplicationComponent","name":"DPI-H National Health Workforce Directory/Registry","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-350840520ae44f658b6ad3b3762e382e.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-4e0767822dcf46409554156a133fbc67","type":"ApplicationComponent","name":"DPI-H: Facility Registry","layer":"Application","documentation":"https://worldhealthorganization.github.io/smart-ra/ActorDefinition-FacilityRegistry.html","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-4e0767822dcf46409554156a133fbc67.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-bbd18f65be45490fbbaf02346511ae5e","type":"ApplicationComponent","name":"Reporting Module","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-bbd18f65be45490fbbaf02346511ae5e.jsonld"},{"key":"ra_id","value":""}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-58e4795bc57845649434ec98dfb53fa4","type":"ApplicationFunction","name":"CRUD Health Workforce Record","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-58e4795bc57845649434ec98dfb53fa4.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-b3a5209e0e88419382a678964bed91f9","type":"ApplicationFunction","name":"Generate Reports","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-b3a5209e0e88419382a678964bed91f9.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-70448b30ed3b43a1bbfea442a3f32388","type":"ApplicationFunction","name":"READ Health Workforce Record","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-70448b30ed3b43a1bbfea442a3f32388.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-7a7f13e6c56d4c4fa3c37ca598a8be1c","type":"ApplicationFunction","name":"READ License Status","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-7a7f13e6c56d4c4fa3c37ca598a8be1c.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-1c8c036d817d47d89af422dc49cc9620","type":"ApplicationService","name":"Data Reporting & Visualization Service","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-1c8c036d817d47d89af422dc49cc9620.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-646c18afcfc54f4fb33ae93110e02c2c","type":"ApplicationService","name":"Identity Management Service","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-646c18afcfc54f4fb33ae93110e02c2c.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-2dbeabd4fadb4f4ca856fcab56c79ce6","type":"ApplicationService","name":"Registry Management Service","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-2dbeabd4fadb4f4ca856fcab56c79ce6.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-067f3a0e91b2452ba1786d129e309017","type":"ApplicationService","name":"Verification & Validation Service","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-067f3a0e91b2452ba1786d129e309017.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-ad969289cb774307aa678037c56fdd3f","type":"DataObject","name":"Facility","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-ad969289cb774307aa678037c56fdd3f.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-702c24bbd73341be9afc11c7e11e9810","type":"DataObject","name":"Health Worker","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-702c24bbd73341be9afc11c7e11e9810.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-301912f3fcaf4648b0ebc3cbbfc3b447","type":"DataObject","name":"Terminology","layer":"Application","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-301912f3fcaf4648b0ebc3cbbfc3b447.jsonld"}],"folder":["Application","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-57355ace4e704cf49bfd82e616a617ac","type":"Outcome","name":"Health worker density at subnational level; distribution by facility ownership and by facility type (1-02, 1-05, 1-06)","layer":"Motivation","documentation":"1-02: \"Density of active health workers per 10 000 population at subnational level.\" 1-05: \"Percentage of active health workers employed by facility ownership.\" 1-06: \"Percentage of active health workers employed by facility type.\" Part of Module 1. Each worker's facility comes from the facility registry. Term indicator-1-02, indicator-1-05, indicator-1-06 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Motivation"]},{"id":"id-49168f20ee2d46f2b1a991051ab5a02d","type":"Outcome","name":"NHWA Module 1: Stock and flow","layer":"Motivation","documentation":"\"This module provides a comprehensive overview of the size, composition and distribution of the HWF as well as its flow throughout the HLM.\" Indicators 1-01 to 1-12. The health workforce registry or database is a named data source for all but 1-11. Term module-1 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Motivation"]},{"id":"id-87a3589d681c4d8e9b2ada5d72db9eb0","type":"Outcome","name":"NHWA Module 2: Education","layer":"Motivation","documentation":"\"This module addresses capacity and quality in HWF education and training.\" Indicators 2-01 to 2-07. The health workforce registry or database is a named data source for 2-04. Term module-2 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Motivation"]},{"id":"id-f3da9bf103a341d28717012ddfb83ae2","type":"Outcome","name":"NHWA Module 3: Finance and expenditures","layer":"Motivation","documentation":"\"This module covers finance and expenditures for active health workers and for the education and training of health workers.\" Indicators 3-01 to 3-05. Their data sources do not include the registry. Term module-3 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Motivation"]},{"id":"id-4cb8cc587d6c4764837e79518dfa2049","type":"Outcome","name":"NHWA Module 4: Working conditions, governance and leadership","layer":"Motivation","documentation":"\"This module addresses working conditions, governance and leadership from various perspectives: health workers, national leadership capacity, and contribution of the country to regional and global mandates.\" Indicators 4-01 to 4-05. Their data sources do not include the registry. Term module-4 in the nhwa-2023 glossary (litlfred/who-iris glossary/nhwa-2023.glossary.json), from National health workforce accounts: a handbook, 2nd ed. (WHO 2023, ISBN 9789240081291).","properties":[{"key":"overlay:owner","value":"dth-hrh"}],"folder":["Motivation"]},{"id":"id-0f846746da49424ca22381bd80bfc409","type":"Goal","name":"A Central Health Workforce Registry","layer":"Motivation","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-0f846746da49424ca22381bd80bfc409.jsonld"}],"folder":["Motivation","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-a423086366604d2a9ea403aa8f19f264","type":"Outcome","name":"Availability of National Workforce to Location Analytics","layer":"Motivation","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-a423086366604d2a9ea403aa8f19f264.jsonld"}],"folder":["Motivation","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-d1b556b9ac4940eeb49f44f9a78b825a","type":"Outcome","name":"Enabled Health Worker Verification","layer":"Motivation","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-d1b556b9ac4940eeb49f44f9a78b825a.jsonld"}],"folder":["Motivation","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-558aba849cc54d659ef1a5473d9aa2f1","type":"Outcome","name":"Establishment of Authoritative National Health Workforce Registry","layer":"Motivation","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.2.0/elements/id-558aba849cc54d659ef1a5473d9aa2f1.jsonld"}],"folder":["Motivation","smart-ra (base, reference copies)"]},{"id":"id-3463482224324a95a77b808562828a38","type":"Outcome","name":"Unique and Verifiable Health Worker ID","layer":"Motivation","properties":[{"key":"overlay:base","value":"https://litlfred.githu